    rdfs:label "Nelson et al. (2017) Development & Kim et al. (2015) Dev. Cell microfluidic transmural pressure, Laplace epithelial wall stress, and ASM peristalsis driving embryonic lung branching (Mus musculus & Gallus gallus (Embryonic lung airway tree under microfluidic transmural pressure control))",
        "Nelson et al. (2017) Development & Kim et al. (2015) Dev. Cell microfluidic transmural pressure, Laplace epithelial wall stress, and ASM peristalsis driving embryonic lung branching faithfully reproduces Mus musculus & Gallus gallus (Embryonic lung airway tree under microfluidic transmural pressure control) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Mus musculus & Gallus gallus (Embryonic lung airway tree under microfluidic transmural pressure control) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 52.6/100, audit 2026-10-19-tracheal-viscous-fingering-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py> ;
    schema:about "Mus musculus & Gallus gallus (Embryonic lung airway tree under microfluidic transmural pressure control)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py; output: docs/media/tracheal_viscous_fingering_comparison.png; organism: Mus musculus & Gallus gallus (Embryonic lung airway tree under microfluidic transmural pressure control); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 3ff5590a2e90cba39f3787578e96d03eba17c0eb535c7b4f860a74e9898f90de; artifact_sha256: c3caf793f5996b270d1667111ff0738b35c3df7b5e149eae303592fc699a996f; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/embryonic_lung_branching_specimen.jpg=8086ebb8b44cbdff..., datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/paper_citations.bib=147c24db66fc3582..., datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/scout_manifest.json=5ca9d0b7e3b9f2d2..., datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/tracheal_viscous_fingering_reference.json=da4d1143ccb80d60...}" ;
